{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415661","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415661","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1041566101:1":{"text":"Hey, pinkskin. Move out of the way.","source_cn":"……让开，生者。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70D272C39F9EFC90","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041566102:1":{"text":"Ah... this chill flesh, a vessel devoid of warmth...","source_cn":"哦？这冰凉的肌肤，毫无生命力蕴藏的躯体……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0BD365770BBD2E7F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041566103:1":{"text":"I have heard sad tales of your kind. Beautiful child, are you one of those known as the Graveborn?","source_cn":"我曾经听闻过外界相关的传闻，美丽的孩子，你就是亡灵吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE3399239CCACD16E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041566104:1":{"text":"Yes, you can tell your friends that you've met one! Now get out of my way.","source_cn":"你现在知道了，让开。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD71D0AB7B019E7F9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041566105:0":{"text":"Stories of the Graveborn were first spoken to us by Her Majesty's own lips.","source_cn":"亡灵的传闻，还是伟大的女王陛下为我等讲述的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x09ECC2340FEE869F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041566106:1":{"text":"That boy Ravion asked a rude question at that time.","source_cn":"沙利叶那孩子当时还提了一个失礼的问题。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB618334D9AFC9FD7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041566107:1":{"text":"\"When a Graveborn looks upon the ones who killed and revived them... do they see an enemy they hate or a parent that created them?\"","source_cn":"——“对亡灵来说，杀死他们的是仇人，还是造就他们的父母呢？”","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8FD8B5AEE1B2278E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041566108:1":{"text":"... Another word and I'll stop playing nice.","source_cn":"……你再说一句，我就不客气了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD7447AE701FBA180","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041566109:1":{"text":"I see an interesting glint in your eyes, my dear child.","source_cn":"我在你的眼中看到了一些有趣的光芒，美丽的孩子。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x89A776CD76794C9A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041566110:1":{"text":"So, it was your elders who bestowed upon you the gift of life, and thus you owe them your deepest gratitude and unwavering devotion, is that correct?","source_cn":"所以，你有着为你赋予生命的长者，你是如此感激又依赖着对...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5E96A4BDBAD4B756","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041566111:1":{"text":"I do, but it's out of loyalty.","source_cn":"我有，但我认为那是基本的忠诚。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7E062DF7DE996581","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041566112:1":{"text":"Indeed, loyalty... yet I perceive this sentiment transcends mere duty or familial bonds. There is something far deeper at play.","source_cn":"那当然是忠诚，孩子，但我认为，那感情更胜于朴素的忠义或...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x76A353354CC59FA3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041566113:1":{"text":"I would call it faith.","source_cn":"我愿意称之为——信仰。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC542A3029891454D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1041566114:1":{"text":"Don't waste my time, lady. You can bring your crazy act somewhere else.","source_cn":"……真是浪费时间，说到底还是个疯了的神棍。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE89DD8A75C524245","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1041566115:1":{"text":"You'll come to understand this, child.","source_cn":"你会明白的，孩子。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC7FAF7D2B29F0D07","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1041566116:1":{"text":"The only thing that can surpass loyalty is absolute faith.","source_cn":"能够超越忠诚的，只有虔诚。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x329B429126C55AE5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:波妮":{"text":"Bonnie","source":"波妮","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:奎茵":{"text":"Velara","source":"奎茵","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":17,"localized_text_count":16,"speaker_count":2}}